      {
        "u_message": "Readiness is confirmed and Flora gives you an escape charm. Your existing armor is kept; missing pieces are entrusted only once. Equip and pack what you need, then activate the charm inside her manor. The attack waits for your explicit confirmation. Escape by the western road or southern garden; you need not kill the apostles.",
        "type": "warning",
        "popup": true
